title: "pH-Responsive Carboxyl-Functionalized Graphene Quantum Dots for Anticancer Drug Delivery: Computational Record"
abstract: >-
  Inputs, submission scripts, quality-control tooling, run log, and derived
  results for a three-phase computational study of anticancer drug loading on
  a carboxyl-functionalized graphene quantum dot.
